  "bodyHtml": "<p>Although <strong>The Highway Code</strong> shows many of the signs commonly in use, a comprehensive explanation of our signing system is given in the Department’s booklet <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/know-your-traffic-signs\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Know Your Traffic Signs</a>, which is on sale at booksellers. The booklet also illustrates and explains the vast majority of signs the road user is likely to encounter.</p>\n\n<p>The signs illustrated in <strong>The Highway Code</strong> are not all drawn to the same scale. In Wales, bilingual versions of some signs are used including Welsh and English versions of place names. Some older designs of signs may still be seen on the roads.</p>\n\n<div>\n<p><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/68f8d5c5ec6267c615ed8f99/the-highway-code-traffic-signs.pdf\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Download ‘Traffic signs’ (PDF, 821KB)</a></p>\n</div>\n\nSigns giving orders\n\n<p><strong>Signs with red circles are mostly prohibitive. Plates below signs qualify their message.</strong></p>\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b9f29740f0b6151f000013/sign-giving-order-entry-20-zone.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nEntry to 20 mph zone\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/57f76285e5274a0eb7000029/sign-giving-order-end-20-zonev2.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nEnd of 20 mph zone\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b9f2dd40f0b6151f000015/sign-giving-order-maximum-speed.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nMaximum speed\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b9f2f740f0b6151c00001d/sign-giving-order-national-speed-limit.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nNational speed limit applies\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b9f31040f0b6151f000017/sign-giving-order-school-crossing-patrol.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nSchool crossing patrol\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b9f330e5274a151e000022/sign-giving-order-stop-give-way.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nStop and give way\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b9f373ed915d155f00001e/sign-giving-order-give-way.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nGive way to traffic on major road\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b9f3d040f0b6151c00001f/sign-giving-order-manually-stop.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nManually operated temporary STOP and GO signs\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b9f3f1e5274a152100001f/sign-giving-order-manually-go.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nManually operated temporary STOP and GO signs\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b9f41b40f0b6151f000019/sign-giving-order-no-entry-vehicular-traffic.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nNo entry for vehicular traffic\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b9f489e5274a151e000024/sign-giving-order-no-vehicles.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nNo vehicles except bicycles being pushed\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b9f4a5ed915d155c00000f/sign-giving-order-no-cycling.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nNo cycling\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b9f4d840f0b6151f00001b/sign-giving-order-no-motor-vehicles.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nNo motor vehicles\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b9f4f0ed915d155f000020/sign-giving-order-no-buses.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nNo buses (over 8 passenger seats)\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b9f50240f0b6151c000021/sign-giving-order-no-overtaking.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nNo overtaking\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b9f52540f0b6151c000023/sign-giving-order-no-towed-caravans.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nNo towed caravans\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b9f562e5274a1521000021/sign-giving-order-no-vehicles-carry-explosives.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nNo vehicles carrying explosives\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/58171318e5274a03bd000004/sign-giving-order-no-vehicle-combination-length.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nNo vehicle or combination of vehicles over length shown\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b9f5dc40f0b6151c000025/sign-giving-order-no-vehicles-over-height.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nNo vehicles over height shown\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b9f60aed915d155f000022/sign-giving-order-no-vehicle-width.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nNo vehicles over width shown\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b9f637e5274a151e000026/sign-giving-order-give-priority-vehicles.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nGive priority to vehicles from opposite direction\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b9f66fe5274a151e000028/sign-giving-order-no-right-turn.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nNo right turn\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b9f68740f0b6151f000021/sign-giving-order-no-left-turn.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nNo left turn\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b9f6aded915d155f000024/sign-giving-order-no-u-turn.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nNo U-turns\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b9f6d8e5274a151e00002a/sign-giving-order-no-goods-vehicle-over-weight.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nNo goods vehicles over maximum gross weight shown (in tonnes) except for loading and unloading\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b9ffe8e5274a151e00002c/sign-giving-order-no-vehicles-max-gross-weight.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nNo vehicles over maximum gross weight shown (in tonnes)\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55ba0058ed915d155c000011/sign-giving-order-park-restrict-permit-holders.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nParking restricted to permit holders\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55ba0070e5274a151e00002e/sign-giving-order-red-route.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nNo stopping during period indicated except for buses\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55ba008eed915d155f000028/sign-giving-order-no-stopping-times.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nNo stopping during times shown except for as long as necessary to set down or pick up passengers\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55ba00a140f0b6151f000025/sign-giving-order-no-waiting.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nNo waiting\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55ba00b540f0b6151c000027/sign-giving-order-no-stopping.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nNo stopping (Clearway)\n\nSigns with blue circles but no red border mostly give positive instruction.\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55cb16d9e5274a5473000021/sign-giving-order-ahead-only.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nAhead only\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55ba11ffe5274a151e000030/sign-giving-order-turn-left-ahead.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nTurn left ahead (right if symbol reversed)\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55ba1211ed915d155c000017/sign-giving-order-turn-left.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nTurn left (right if symbol reversed)\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55ba123bed915d155c000019/sign-giving-order-keep-left.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nKeep left (right if symbol reversed)\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55ba124eed915d155c00001b/sign-giving-order-vehicle-pass-either-side.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nVehicles may pass either side to reach same destination\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55ba126540f0b6151c00002b/sign-giving-order-mini-roundabout.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nMini-roundabout (roundabout circulation - give way to vehicles from the immediate right)\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55ba1284e5274a1521000023/sign-giving-order-route-pedal-cycles-only.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nRoute to be used by pedal cycles only\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55ba12b1ed915d155c00001d/sign-giving-order-segregated-cycle-pedestrian-route.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nSegregated pedal cycle and pedestrian route\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55ba12c140f0b6151f000027/sign-giving-order-minimum-speed.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nMinimum speed\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55ba12d3e5274a151e000032/sign-giving-order-minimum-speed-end.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nEnd of minimum speed\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/68e3cbcc49e17d00a56ffe3c/sign-giving-order-buses-cycles-only.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nBuses and cycles only\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/68e3cbba8c1db6022d0ca152/sign-giving-order-trams-only.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nTrams only\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55ba131840f0b6151c00002d/sign-giving-order-pedestrian-crossing-tramway.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nPedestrian crossing point over tramway\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55ba132ee5274a151e000036/sign-giving-order-one-way-traffic.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nOne-way traffic (note: compare circular ‘Ahead only’ sign)\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55ba1353e5274a1521000027/sign-giving-order-with-flow-bus-cycle-lane.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nWith-flow bus and cycle lane\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55ba136ded915d155f00002a/sign-giving-order-contra-flow-bus-lane.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nContra-flow bus lane\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55ba1383ed915d155c00001f/sign-giving-order-with-flow-pedal-cycle-lane.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nWith-flow pedal cycle lane\n\nWarning signs\n\nMostly triangular\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b75e26ed915d07e2000007/warning-sign-distance-to-stop-line-ahead-100-yards.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nDistance to ‘STOP’ line ahead\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b75e47e5274a215200000c/warning-sign-dual-carriageway-ends.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nDual carriageway ends\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b75eeded915d07fe000005/warning-sign-road-narrow.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nRoad narrows on right (left if symbol reversed)\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b75f15ed915d07fe000007/warning-sign-road-narrow-both-sides.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nRoad narrows on both sides\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b75f36e5274a215200000e/warning-sign-distance-to-stop-line-ahead-50-yards.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nDistance to ‘Give Way’ line ahead\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b7696640f0b6790f000011/warning-sign-crossroads.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nCrossroads\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b7698540f0b6790f000013/warning-sign-junction-on-bend-ahead.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nJunction on bend ahead\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b769b2ed915d07e200000b/warning-sign-t-junction-with-priority.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nT-junction with priority over vehicles from the right\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b769e040f0b67aa300000d/warning-sign-staggered-junction.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nStaggered junction\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b76a04ed915d07fe000009/warning-sign-traffic-merging-left.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nTraffic merging from left ahead\n\n<p><strong>The priority through route is indicated by the broader line.</strong></p>\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b76a2d40f0b6790f000015/warning-sign-double-bend.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nDouble bend first to left (symbol may be reversed)\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b76a5d40f0b67aa300000f/warning-sign-bend-to-right.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nBend to right (or left if symbol reversed)\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b76a79ed915d07fe00000b/warning-sign-roundabout.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nRoundabout\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b76a9240f0b6790f000017/warning-sign-uneven-road.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nUneven road\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b76ab240f0b67aa3000011/warning-sign-plate-below-some-signs.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nPlate below some signs\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b76af8ed915d07fe00000d/warning-sign-two-way-traffic-crosses-road.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nTwo-way traffic crosses one-way road\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b76b1e40f0b67aa3000013/warning-sign-two-way-traffic-ahead.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nTwo-way traffic straight ahead\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b76b42e5274a21ec00000a/warning-sign-swing-bridge.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nOpening or swing bridge ahead\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b76b6840f0b67aa3000015/warning-sign-aircraft.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nLow-flying aircraft or sudden aircraft noise\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b76b81ed915d07fe00000f/warning-sign-falling-rocks.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nFalling or fallen rocks\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b76bbbed915d07fe000011/warning-sign-traffic-signals-not-in-use.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nTraffic signals not in use\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b76bd2e5274a21ec00000c/warning-sign-traffic-signals.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nTraffic signals\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b76bec40f0b6790f000019/warning-sign-slippery-road.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nSlippery road\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b76c11ed915d07fe000013/warning-sign-steep-hill-downwards.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nSteep hill downwards\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b76c2de5274a21ec00000e/warning-sign-steep-hill-upwards.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nSteep hill upwards\n\n<p><strong>Gradients may be shown as a ratio i.e. 20% = 1:5</strong></p>\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b76c51e5274a21ec000010/warning-sign-tunnel-ahead.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nTunnel ahead\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b76c82ed915d07fe000015/warning-sign-trams-crossing-ahead.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nTrams crossing ahead\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b76ca6e5274a2152000010/warning-sign-level-crossing-ahead-barrier-or-gate.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nLevel crossing with barrier or gate ahead\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b76cf940f0b67aa3000017/warning-sign-level-crossing-ahead-without-barrier.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nLevel crossing without barrier or gate ahead\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b76d18ed915d07e200000d/warning-sign-level-crossing-without-barrier-ahead.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nLevel crossing without barrier\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b76da940f0b67aa3000019/warning-sign-school-crossing-patrol-ahead.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nSchool crossing patrol ahead (some signs have amber lights which flash when crossings are in use)\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b76ddc40f0b6790f00001b/warning-sign-frail-pedestrians-cross-road-ahead.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nFrail (or blind or disabled if shown) pedestrians likely to cross road ahead\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b76dfbed915d07fe000017/warning-sign-pedestrians-in-road-ahead.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nPedestrians in road ahead\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b76e1040f0b6790f00001d/warning-sign-zebra-crossing.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nZebra crossing\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5817085d40f0b64c34000000/warning-sign-overhead-electric-cables.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nOverhead electric cable; plate indicates maximum height of vehicles which can pass safely\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b76e75e5274a2152000012/warning-sign-available-width-head-room.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nAvailable width of headroom indicated\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b76ecae5274a21ec000014/warning-sign-sharp-deviation-of-route.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nSharp deviation of route to left (or right if chevrons reversed)\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b76ef9e5274a21ec000016/warning-sign-light-signals-ahead.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nLight signals ahead at level crossing, airfield or bridge\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b76f4440f0b6790f00001f/warning-sign-level-crossing-minature.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nMiniature warning lights at level crossings\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b76f56e5274a21ec000018/warning-sign-cattle.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nCattle\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b76f70e5274a21ec00001a/warning-sign-wild-animals.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nWild animals\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b76f87ed915d07fe000019/warning-sign-wild-horses.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nWild horses or ponies\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b76fa6ed915d07fe00001b/warning-sign-accompanied-horses.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nAccompanied horses or ponies\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b76fbced915d07e200000f/warning-sign-cycle-route-ahead.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nCycle route ahead\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b76fd9e5274a2152000014/warning-sign-risk-of-ice.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nRisk of ice\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b76ffa40f0b6790f000021/warning-sign-traffic-queues.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nTraffic queues likely ahead\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b7701940f0b6790f000023/warning-sign-distance-humps-extend.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nDistance over which road humps extend\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b7703fe5274a21ec00001c/warning-sign-other-danger.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nOther danger; plate indicates nature of danger\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b77056ed915d07fe00001d/warning-sign-soft-verges.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nSoft verges\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b7706940f0b67aa300001b/warning-sign-side-winds.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nSide winds\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b7707ae5274a21ec00001e/warning-sign-hump-bridge.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nHump bridge\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b7708fed915d07fe00001f/warning-sign-worded-sign-ford.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nWorded warning sign\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b770aaed915d07fe000021/warning-sign-quayside-or-riverbank.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nQuayside or river bank\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b770c3ed915d07fe000023/warning-sign-risk-of-grounding.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nRisk of grounding\n\nDirection signs\n\nMostly rectangular\n\nSigns on motorways - blue backgrounds\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8a448e5274a1521000001/direction-sign-blue-junction-leading-to-motorway.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nAt a junction leading directly into a motorway (junction number may be shown on a black background)\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8a47b40f0b6151c000001/direction-sign-blue-approach-to-junction.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nOn approaches to junctions (junction number on black background)\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8a49e40f0b6151f000001/direction-sign-blue-route-sign.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nRoute confirmatory sign after junction\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8a4c0ed915d155c000005/direction-sign-blue-get-in-lane.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nDownward pointing arrows mean ‘Get in lane’ \nThe left-hand lane leads to a different destination from the other lanes.\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8a4e940f0b6151c000003/direction-sign-blue-destination-leaving-motorway.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nThe panel with the inclined arrow indicates the destinations which can be reached by leaving the motorway at the next junction\n\nSigns on primary routes - green backgrounds\n\n<p>Blue panels indicate that the motorway starts at the junction ahead.\nMotorways shown in brackets can also be reached along the route indicated. White panels indicate local or non-primary routes leading from the junction ahead.\nBrown panels show the route to tourist attractions.\nThe name of the junction may be shown at the top of the sign.\nThe aircraft symbol indicates the route to an airport.\nA symbol may be included to warn of a hazard or restriction along that route.</p>\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8a74fed915d155c000007/direction-sign-green-approach-junction-roundabout.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nOn approaches to junctions\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/581715bded915d61c5000007/direction-sign-green-at-junction.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nAt the junction\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8a7afed915d155f000003/direction-sign-green-route-sign.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nRoute confirmatory sign after junction\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8a7cce5274a1521000003/direction-sign-green-approach-junction.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nOn approaches to junctions\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8a7e7e5274a151e000001/direction-sign-green-billingual.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nOn approach to a junction in Wales (bilingual)\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8a812e5274a1521000005/direction-sign-green-ring-road-crossroads.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nPrimary route forming part of a ring road\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8a82ce5274a151e000003/direction-sign-green-primary-route-ring-road.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nPrimary route forming part of a ring road\n\nSigns on non-primary and local routes - black borders\n\n<p>Green panels indicate that the primary route starts at the junction ahead. Route numbers on a blue background show the direction to a motorway. Route numbers on a green background show the direction to a primary route.</p>\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8aeabed915d155f000005/direction-sign-black-border-approach-junction-crossroads.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nOn approaches to junctions\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8aec7ed915d155f000007/direction-sign-black-border-approach-junction.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nOn approaches to junctions\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8aef1e5274a151e00000f/direction-sign-black-border-at-junction.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nAt the junction\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8af1540f0b6151c000007/direction-sign-black-border-toilets-disabled-access.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nDirection to toilets with access for the disabled\n\nOther direction signs\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8a938e5274a1521000007/direction-sign-other-picnic-site.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nPicnic site\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8a952e5274a151e000005/direction-sign-other-english-heritage.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nAncient monument in the care of English Heritage\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8a965e5274a151e000007/direction-sign-other-direction-car-park.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nDirection to a car park\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8a98740f0b6151f000005/direction-sign-other-tourist-attraction.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nTourist attraction\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8a9a140f0b6151f000007/direction-sign-other-camping-caravan.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nDirection to camping and caravan site\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8a9b9e5274a151e000009/direction-sign-other-advisory-route-lorries.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nAdvisory route for lorries\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8ab18e5274a1521000009/direction-sign-other-route-pedal-cycles.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nRoute for pedal cycles forming part of a network\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8ab49e5274a151e00000b/direction-sign-other-recommended-route-cycle.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nRecommended route for pedal cycles to place shown\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8ab66e5274a152100000b/direction-sign-other-route-pedestrians.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nRoute for pedestrians\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8ab86ed915d155c000009/direction-sign-other-emergency-diversion-square.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nSymbols showing emergency diversion route for motorway and other main road traffic\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8abace5274a151e00000d/direction-sign-other-emergency-diversion-triangle.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nSymbols showing emergency diversion route for motorway and other main road traffic\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8abc2e5274a152100000d/direction-sign-other-emergency-diversion-diamond.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nSymbols showing emergency diversion route for motorway and other main road traffic\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8abd6e5274a152100000f/direction-sign-other-emergency-diversion-circle.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nSymbols showing emergency diversion route for motorway and other main road traffic\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8abf540f0b6151c000005/direction-sign-other-diversion-route.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nDiversion route\n\nInformation signs\n\nAll rectangular\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8bc8040f0b6151c000009/Information-sign-entrance-controlled-parking-zone.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nEntrance to controlled parking zone\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8bc98ed915d155f000009/Information-sign-entrance-congestion-zone.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nEntrance to congestion charging zone\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8bcab40f0b6151c00000b/Information-sign-end-controlled-parking-zone.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nEnd of controlled parking zone\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8bcc340f0b6151c00000d/Information-sign-advance-warning-restriction-ahead.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nAdvance warning of restriction or prohibition ahead\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8bcdfed915d155f00000b/Information-sign-parking-place-solo-motorcycles.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nParking place for solo motorcycles\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8bcf4e5274a151e000013/Information-sign-with-flow-bus-lane-ahead.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nWith-flow bus lane ahead which pedal cycles and taxis may also use\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8bd2aed915d155c00000b/Information-sign-lane-for-hov.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\n \n\n<p>Lane designated for use by high occupancy vehicles (HOV) - see <a href=\"/code/rule/142\">rule 142</a></p>\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8bd4140f0b6151c00000f/Information-sign-vehicles-permitted-HOV-lane.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nVehicles permitted to use an HOV lane ahead\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8bd5b40f0b6151f000009/Information-sign-motorway-end.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nEnd of motorway\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8bd6fe5274a151e000015/Information-sign-start-motorway.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nStart of motorway and point from which motorway regulations apply\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8bd89e5274a1521000011/Information-sign-appropriate-traffic-lanes-junction.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nAppropriate traffic lanes at junction ahead\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8bdefed915d155f00000d/Information-sign-traffic-on-carriageway-priority.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nTraffic on the main carriageway coming from right has priority over joining traffic\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8be2440f0b6151c000011/Information-sign-addtional-traffic-joining-left.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nAdditional traffic joining from left ahead. Traffic on main carriageway has priority over joining traffic from right hand lane of slip road\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8be5540f0b6151c000013/Information-sign-traffic-joining-right-hand-slip-road.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nTraffic in right hand lane of slip road joining the main carriageway has priority over left hand lane\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/613a0b1e8fa8f503c6403de0/variable_speed_limit.png\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nVariable speed limit with camera enforcement sign.\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/560bc777e5274a0369000024/information-sign-motorway-exit-countdown-markers.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\n‘Countdown’ markers at exit from motorway (each bar represents 100 yards to the exit). Green-backed markers may be used on primary routes and white-backed markers with black bars on other routes. At approaches to concealed level crossings white-backed markers with red bars may be used. Although these will be erected at equal distances the bars do not represent 100 yard intervals.\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8beb3ed915d155f000011/Information-sign-motorway-service.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nMotorway service area sign showing the operator’s name\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8befce5274a151e000017/Information-sign-traffic-priority-over-oncoming-vehicles.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nTraffic has priority over oncoming vehicles\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8c000ed915d155f000014/Information-sign-hospital-a-and-e.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nHospital ahead with Accident and Emergency facilities\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8c01340f0b6151c000015/Information-sign-tourist-info-point.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nTourist information point\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8c026e5274a1521000015/Information-sign-no-through-road.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nNo through road for vehicles\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8c063e5274a151e00001a/Information-sign-recommended-route-cycles.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nRecommended route for pedal cycles\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8c079e5274a1521000017/Information-sign-home-zone-entry.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nHome Zone Entry\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8c091ed915d155f000016/Information-sign-camera-area.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nArea in which cameras are used to enforce traffic regulations\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8c0a6ed915d155c00000d/Information-sign-bus-lane-road-junction-ahead.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nBus lane on road at junction ahead\n\nRoad work signs\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8c3b2ed915d155f000018/road-work-sign-road-works.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nRoad works\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8c3c240f0b6151c000017/road-work-sign-loose-chippings.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nLoose chippings\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8c3dbed915d155f00001a/road-work-sign-temporary-hazard.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nTemporary hazard at road works\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8c3f140f0b6151f00000d/road-work-sign-temporary-lane-closure.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nTemporary lane closure (the number and position of arrows and red bars may be varied according to lanes open and closed)\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8c413ed915d155f00001c/road-work-sign-back-vehicle-direction-arrow.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nSlow-moving or stationary works vehicle blocking a traffic lane. Pass in the direction shown by the arrow.\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8c42740f0b6151c000019/road-work-sign-mandatory-speed-limit.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nMandatory speed limit ahead\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8c43ee5274a151e00001c/road-work-sign-road-works-ahead.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nRoad works 1 mile ahead\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/55b8c45540f0b6151c00001b/road-work-sign-end-road-works.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nEnd of road works and any temporary restrictions including speed limits\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8c476e5274a1521000019/road-work-sign-back-vehicle-800-yards.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nSigns used on the back of slow-moving or stationary vehicles warning of a lane closed ahead by a works vehicle. There are no cones on the road.\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8c486e5274a152100001b/road-work-sign-back-vehicle450-yards.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nSigns used on the back of slow-moving or stationary vehicles warning of a lane closed ahead by a works vehicle. There are no cones on the road.\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8c4a640f0b6151f00000f/road-work-sign-lane-restriction.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nLane restrictions at road works ahead\n\n<p><a class=\"hc-image\" href=\"https://assets.digital.cabinet-office.gov.uk/media/55b8c4b840f0b6151f000011/road-work-sign-lane-crossover.jpg\" rel=\"external noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Diagram (online): view image</a></p>\nOne lane crossover at contraflow road works\n\n",
